[[Category:Creatures]]

Toads are one of the few creatures, alongside [[Chicken]]s, [[Rabbit]]s and [[Rat]]s, that can be attacked without them fighting back. This makes them good in helping novices figure out the [[Combat moves|Combat System]].

Toads are needed to create the curiosity [[Enthroned Toad]]

